                <pb facs="0368" n="286" xml:id="pg286"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/618.</note>
                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-08-03T07:00:00-04:49"><hi rendition="#small-caps">August</hi>
                            3, 1911—7 <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                    >a.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>The German war vessel landed about 40 men at 10 o’clock, although there was no
                    apparent necessity for such action, as from personal observation the streets
                    were quiet and deserted.</p>
